{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30968","headline":"题九华山 · 谭铢","name":"题九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆闻九华山，尚在童稚年。\n浮沈任名路，窥仰会无缘。\n罢职池阳时，复遭迎送牵。\n因兹契诚愿，瞩望枕席前。\n况值春正浓，气色无不全。\n或如碧玉静，或似青霭鲜。\n或接白云堆，或暎红霞天。\n呈姿既不一，变态何啻千。\n巍峩本无动，崇峻性岂偏。\n外景自隐隐，潜虚固幽玄。\n我来暗凝情，务道志更坚。\n色与山异性，性并山亦然。\n境变山不动，性存形自迁。\n自迁不阻俗，自定不失贤。\n浮华与朱紫，安可迷心田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谭铢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}